{"title":"Career Roadmap: Statutory Auditor","role":"Statutory Auditor","summary":"Career Domain: Business, Finance & Entrepreneurship · Qualification Pathway: Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India – Chartered Accountancy (CA - ICAI) · Target Career: Statutory Auditor","facts":{"Current degree":"Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India","Course":"Chartered Accountancy (CA - ICAI)"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Statutory Auditor checks a company's financial statements every year, as the law requires, and gives an independent opinion on whether they are true and fair."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Statutory Auditor does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plan and carry out the annual audit"},{"text":"Test transactions, controls and balances"},{"text":"Discuss findings with management"},{"text":"Issue the audit report under the Companies Act"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CA firms (Big 4, mid-size, small)"},{"text":"Own practice"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Article Assistant"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Audit Associate"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Audit Manager"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Audit Partner"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Senior Partner"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Foundation: Basics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear CA Foundation"},{"text":"Learn accounting thoroughly"},{"text":"Learn Excel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Intermediate: Audit and accounts"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear CA Intermediate"},{"text":"Focus on auditing and accounting standards"},{"text":"Learn the Companies Act basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Articleship: Audit exposure"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Choose an audit-heavy firm"},{"text":"Work on statutory and bank audits"},{"text":"Learn audit documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final: Qualify"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear CA Final"},{"text":"Get the Certificate of Practice"},{"text":"Join an audit team or start practice"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Note","text":"Only a practising CA (or a CA firm) can be appointed statutory auditor of a company."}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Standards on Auditing"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Ind AS"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Internal controls"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Audit sampling and analytics"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Independence"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Scepticism"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Clear reporting"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audit software (CaseWare and others)"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Data analytics (IDEA)"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Articleship in audit firms"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ICAI DISA (IT audit)"},{"text":"ICAI audit courses"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options after your degree:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"I